# 🎵 AI Music Generator

A Python-based music generation project that creates a new MIDI music file from an existing MIDI input. The project reads musical notes from a MIDI file, processes them, and generates a new sequence of notes to produce a unique composition.

---

## 📌 Features

- 🎼 Reads MIDI files
- 🎹 Extracts musical notes
- 🎵 Generates a new music sequence
- 💾 Saves the generated music as a new MIDI file
- ⚡ Simple and lightweight Python implementation

---

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- Python 3
- music21
- NumPy
- PrettyMIDI

