## 🚀 Installation

Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/your-username/AI-Music-Generator.git
```

Go to the project folder:

```bash
cd AI-Music-Generator
```

Install dependencies:

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

---

## ▶️ How to Run

Place a MIDI file on your computer and update its path in `MUSIC.py`.

Run:

```bash
python MUSIC.py
```

After execution, the program creates:

```
generated_music.mid
```

---

## 📖 How It Works

1. Loads an input MIDI file.
2. Extracts musical notes from the file.
3. Generates a new note sequence.
4. Converts the sequence back into a MIDI file.
5. Saves the generated music as `generated_music.mid`.

